From 111fe0513b20560ad059b456827f308bae540519 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy <andylee77@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/22] sigmastar: platform utilities, the PWM light tool,
 per-vendor lib-serial-mac

The SigmaStar soc, sensor, usb-role and S03mac utilities under
files/sigmastar/, in upstream's per-vendor layout. lib-serial-mac becomes
per-vendor too: the global copy reads Ingenic serial registers, so on other
vendors the hostname suffix came out empty.

sigmastar-light is the light command for boards whose LED banks are
PWM-dimmed. Each board's defconfig names the channels, written to
/etc/default/light.
